<button class="copy-button {{primary ? 'primary' : ''}}" bindtap="copy" disabled="{{!value}}" hover-class="pressed">{{copied ? '已复制' : label}}</button><view wx:if="{{manual}}" class="copy-mask" bindtap="close"><view class="copy-sheet" catchtap="stop"><text class="copy-title">请手动复制</text><text class="copy-help">当前环境不允许自动复制。长按下方链接，选择「复制」，再在浏览器打开。</text><text class="copy-value" user-select selectable>{{value}}</text><button bindtap="close" class="copy-button primary">我知道了</button></view></view>
